<title>CHILE: Concha y Toro posts higher Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Concha y Toro posts higher Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean winery Vina Concha y Toro SA reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>			    Q1 1997		  Q1 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		 1.6			1.4</p>
<p> Operating profit	 1.8			1.2</p>
<p> Non-operating loss   19.6 million   profit 83 million</p>
<p> Total revenues	  10.4			7.9</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
